flowchart TD
      A["scfw proxy -- npm install package"] --> B["Package-manager adapter<br/>reads registry configuration"]
      B --> C["SCFW starts proxy<br/>on an ephemeral local port"]
      C --> D["SCFW launches package manager<br/>with process-local registry overrides"]

      D --> E["Package manager requests<br/>package metadata"]
      E --> F["Local SCFW proxy"]
      F --> G["Forward request to<br/>original registry"]
      G --> H["Registry metadata response"]
      H --> I["Rewrite download URLs<br/>to pass through the proxy"]
      I --> D

      D --> J["Package manager requests<br/>package artifact"]
      J --> F
      F --> K["Identify package<br/>name and version"]
      K --> L["Evaluate package<br/>against Datadog policy"]

      L -->|Allow| M["Download artifact<br/>from original host"]
      M --> N["Return artifact to<br/>package manager"]
      N --> O["Package manager installs package"]

      L -->|Block or error| P["Return HTTP 403<br/>artifact is not downloaded"]

      O --> Q["Command exits"]
      P --> Q
      Q --> R["Stop proxy and remove<br/>temporary configuration"]